function terms(s){return (String(s).toLowerCase().replaceAll('ё','е').replace(/к[еэ]шб[еэ]к/g,'кэшбэк').replace(/москов[а-я]*/g,'москва').match(/[а-яa-z0-9]{2,}/g)||[]).filter(w=>w.length>=3||['зп','км','фл','юл','тб'].includes(w)).filter(w=>!STOP.has(w)).map(w=>w.length>6?w.slice(0,6):w)}
const RAG_INDEX=KNOWLEDGE.map(k=>{const title=terms([k.title,k.section,k.chapter,k.sourceRefs?.join(' ')].filter(Boolean).join(' '));return {k,title:new Set(title),tokens:terms(k.text),all:new Set([...title,...terms(k.text)])}});
const RAG_DF=new Map();for(const row of RAG_INDEX)for(const word of row.all)RAG_DF.set(word,(RAG_DF.get(word)||0)+1);
export function retrieve(text){
 const query=[...new Set(terms(text))];if(!query.length)return [];
 return RAG_INDEX.filter(row=>!['rgs','mmb','opk'].includes(row.k.scope)).map(row=>{
  let score=0;for(const word of query){if(!row.all.has(word))continue;const idf=Math.log(1+(RAG_INDEX.length+.5)/((RAG_DF.get(word)||0)+.5));const tf=row.tokens.filter(w=>w===word).length;score+=idf*((tf*2.2)/(tf+1.2*(.25+.75*row.tokens.length/300))+(row.title.has(word)?2.2:0))}
  if(row.k.sourceType==='registry')score*=.45;if(row.k.quality==='ocr')score*=.82;
  return {k:row.k,score};
 }).filter(v=>v.score>0).sort((a,b)=>b.score-a.score).slice(0,6).map(({k})=>({...k,text:k.text.slice(0,4200)}))
}
